flowchart TD
  U[Guest/User] --> A[Search Hotels]
  A --> B[Select Hotel]
  B --> C[View Rooms & Availability]
  C --> D[Select Room + Dates]
  D --> E{Availability Check}
  E -- available --> F["Create Booking (POST /bookings)"]
  F --> G[Hold / Reserve Room]
  G --> H[Proceed to Payment]
  H --> I[Payment Gateway]
  I -- success --> J[Confirm Booking -> send Confirmation]
  I -- fail --> K[Release Hold -> notify user]
  E -- not available --> L[Show alternatives]
